OL,3,GNEWSATourism tax plans delayed after
OL,4,Athousands respond to consultation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council looks set to delay its
OL,7,Fdecision on imposing a tourism tax in
OL,8,FGwynedd after a public consultation
OL,9,Fprompted thousands of responses from
OL,10,Fvisitors, residents and businesses.
OL,12,FA report to Cyngor Gwynedd said the
OL,13,Fnumber of responses - of which there
OL,14,Fwere 6,856 - exceeded expectations.
OL,16,FThis meant it had "not been possible to
OL,17,Fanalyse, process and consider all the
OL,18,Fconsultation responses" within an
OL,19,Fagreed deadline, it said.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
