OL,3,GNEWSATourism tax plans delayed after
OL,4,Athousands respond to consultation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe majority of businesses and visitors
OL,7,Fwho responded said they were opposed to
OL,8,Fimposing the visitor levy, while 48.7%
OL,9,Fof residents supported it.
